                                                "sense_id": "e43719e1-7710-3750-a40b-b086fcc95429",
                                                "text": "The San Juan market is Mexico City's most famous deli of exotic meats, where an adventurous shopper can hunt down hard-to-find critters such as ostrich, wild boar and crocodile."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d2defda6-fc43-4fd3-bc5e-e40960dc666b",
                                                "sense_id": "e43719e1-7710-3750-a40b-b086fcc95429",
                                                "text": "Part of the 'western arcade' (as it's known) is lined with delis, cafes and other shops, giving it the feeling of a bazaar."
